  source estate-physical-density
  destination retirement-archive
  relation leaves_whole_tree_retirement_to_the_archive
  preserves every release path and byte in place; whole-tree removal stays with the archive's restore-verified path and the owner's approval
  drops nothing; clones and transparent compression only change allocation
  forbidden_inference a densified release tree -> a retired or removable release; it remains a rollback candidate until the archive retires it
